ModMetaData.description:
A patched build of Aerocraft Framework for RimWorld 1.5 that works with Combat Extended 15.6.

It uses the same package id as the original, so addons that depend on Aerocraft Framework (RimThunder - Gruppa Krovi and others) keep working. When both are installed, the game gives this local copy the id and renames the workshop copy to MYDE.AerocraftFramework_steam; enable only this one.

Fixed for Combat Extended:
- colonists reload aircraft and their weapon mounts again: the original called a CE method that no longer exists, and every reload failed at the last moment;
- the aircraft are registered in CE's turret registry, so CE's ammo gizmos and ammo type selection work on them;
- no more "Verb caster is not a turret and does not have a WarmupStance" error spam;
- bombers load CE mortar shells, and bombs, fire foam shells and explosions use CE projectiles;
- rockets fired by weapon mounts no longer hit their own aircraft.

Other fixes: a save could grow on every save (an aircraft following itself was deep-saved into itself), pilots could not be let out, deconstruction gave nothing back, weapons could get lost when switching, weapon kits logged errors, a dialog spammed the log, and many null reference errors.

Interface: an aircraft tab with crew, weapons, ammo bars, reload and ammo type buttons, mounts and bombs; an ammo gizmo for the whole aircraft; "Reload now" and right-click reload orders; inspect lines with ammo and flight status; a clearer settings page; Ukrainian translation.

Settings: auto reload, reloading of stored weapons, servicing only in the home area (off by default: aircraft do not expand the home area).
